# What the M6 demo must show, in order.
elixos-shim: launching generation=0 mode=normal
iex(1)> defmodule Hello do
iex(2)> Elixos.save()
# The shim's line lands on the fresh prompt: IEx prints iex(3)> as soon as
# save returns, before the shim has read NEXT off the control pipe.
iex(3)> elixos-shim: next generation=1
elixos-shim: shutdown poweroff
elixos-shim: plan generation=1 mode=normal attempt=1
iex(1)> Hello.hi()
:persisted
elixos-shim: shutdown poweroff
